{"seq":1,"slug":"demand-forecasting","title":"需求预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications/demand-forecasting","wordCount":1288,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"需求预测\">需求预测</h1><p>需求预测是时间序列预测在商业场景中最广泛的应用——从电商 SKU 级销量预测到电力负荷调度、从供应链库存优化到运力规划。它的独特性在于：预测结果直接驱动运营决策，决策本身又反过来影响需求（促销→需求增加→预测需要考虑促销效应）。这种预测-决策反馈环使需求预测远不止是一个纯统计问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[需求预测系统] --&gt; B[数据输入]&#10;    A --&gt; C[预测引擎]&#10;    A --&gt; D[决策应用]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[历史销量]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[促销日历]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[外部因子: 天气/经济/竞品]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[产品属性: 品类/生命周期/价格]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[基础模型: TimesFM零样本]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[表格模型: LightGBM]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[统计模型: ETS/ARIMA]&#10;    C --&gt; C4[集成: 加权组合]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[库存补货]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[生产排程]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[运力调配]&#10;    D --&gt; D4[促销规划]\">flowchart TD\n    A[需求预测系统] --&gt; B[数据输入]\n    A --&gt; C[预测引擎]\n    A --&gt; D[决策应用]\n    B --&gt; B1[历史销量]\n    B --&gt; B2[促销日历]\n    B --&gt; B3[外部因子: 天气/经济/竞品]\n    B --&gt; B4[产品属性: 品类/生命周期/价格]\n    C --&gt; C1[基础模型: TimesFM零样本]\n    C --&gt; C2[表格模型: LightGBM]\n    C --&gt; C3[统计模型: ETS/ARIMA]\n    C --&gt; C4[集成: 加权组合]\n    D --&gt; D1[库存补货]\n    D --&gt; D2[生产排程]\n    D --&gt; D3[运力调配]\n    D --&gt; D4[促销规划]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预测维度</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>典型预测步长</th>\n<th>核心挑战</th>\n<th>主要方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SKU × 门店</td>\n<td>日/周</td>\n<td>1-4 周</td>\n<td>稀疏性（大量零值）</td>\n<td>零膨胀模型/Croston</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类</td>\n<td>周/月</td>\n<td>1-3 月</td>\n<td>促销效应</td>\n<td>LightGBM + 促销特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域</td>\n<td>月</td>\n<td>3-12 月</td>\n<td>季节+趋势</td>\n<td>ETS/SARIMA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电力负荷</td>\n<td>小时/15min</td>\n<td>24-168h</td>\n<td>温度依赖+多季节</td>\n<td>基础模型/GBM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>呼叫中心</td>\n<td>15min</td>\n<td>日内</td>\n<td>日内多峰</td>\n<td>STL + 回归</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"间歇性需求与稀疏序列\">间歇性需求与稀疏序列</h2><p>电商长尾 SKU 的典型销量模式：大部分天数为 0，偶尔出现 1-3 件销量。传统方法对这类数据失效。</p>\n<p><strong>Croston 方法</strong>：分别预测「需求发生间隔」和「非零需求量」，最终需求率 = 量 / 间隔：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{d}_t = \\frac{\\hat{z}_t}{\\hat{p}_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1079em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{z}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是非零需求的指数平滑估计，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是需求间隔的指数平滑估计。</p>\n<p><strong>零膨胀泊松/负二项回归</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>Poisson</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y=0) = \\pi + (1-\\pi) \\cdot P_{\\text{Poisson}}(0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Poisson</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>Poisson</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y=k) = (1-\\pi) \\cdot P_{\\text{Poisson}}(k), \\quad k &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Poisson</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>2026 年的实践</strong>：TimesFM/Chronos 对间歇性数据的零样本表现仍不如专门的 Croston/TSB 方法，因为预训练数据中稀疏序列占比不足。M5 竞赛（Walmart）验证了 LightGBM + 自定义损失函数在稀疏场景的统治地位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"促销效应建模\">促销效应建模</h2><p>促销是需求预测中最强的因果干预信号。建模方法：</p>\n<p><strong>特征化方法</strong>（LightGBM 系）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>促销类型 one-hot（满减/折扣/赠品/秒杀）</li>\n<li>促销折扣力度（连续值）</li>\n<li>距上次/下次促销的天数</li>\n<li>促销提升因子（Uplift）= 促销期均值 / 基线均值</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>因果效应分离</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msubsup><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>uplift</mtext><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y}_t = \\hat{y}_t^{\\text{baseline}} \\times (1 + \\hat{\\text{uplift}}_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">uplift</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>先预测无促销的基线需求，再乘以促销提升因子。优势：基线模型稳定、促销模型可独立评估。</p>\n<p><strong>cannibalization 与 halo 效应</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>促销 SKU 的需求增长可能来自同品类其他 SKU 的转移（互蚕食）</li>\n<li>也可能带动互补品销量（光环效应）</li>\n<li>需要品类级联合建模而非单 SKU 独立预测</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"层次预测与调和\">层次预测与调和</h2><p>实际业务中，预测需要在多个层次保持一致性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>全国总量</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>区域</mtext></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>门店</mtext></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>SKU</mtext></munder><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>SKU, 门店</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{全国总量} = \\sum_{\\text{区域}} \\sum_{\\text{门店}} \\sum_{\\text{SKU}} y_{t}^{\\text{SKU, 门店}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全国总量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3443em;vertical-align:-1.2943em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">区域</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">门店</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SKU</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9592em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SKU, </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">门店</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>Bottom-up</strong>：在最细粒度预测，逐层求和</p>\n<ul>\n<li>优点：保留细粒度信息</li>\n<li>缺点：细粒度噪声大、稀疏严重</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Top-down</strong>：在最粗粒度预测，按历史比例分配</p>\n<ul>\n<li>优点：粗粒度信号强</li>\n<li>缺点：假设比例稳定（实际可能漂移）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>最优调和（Optimal Reconciliation）</strong>：MinT/WLS 方法同时在所有层次预测，然后通过最小化加权迹来调和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{\\mathbf{y}} = \\mathbf{S}(\\mathbf{S}&#x27;\\mathbf{W}^{-1}\\mathbf{S})^{-1}\\mathbf{S}&#x27;\\mathbf{W}^{-1}\\hat{\\mathbf{y}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8757em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是层次求和矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是残差协方差估计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"新品与冷启动\">新品与冷启动</h2><p>新品没有历史销量数据，这是需求预测的经典难题：</p>\n<p><strong>属性迁移（Attribute-based Transfer）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从相似品的历史中学习需求模式</li>\n<li>相似度定义：品类 + 价格带 + 季节属性 + 品牌力</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>生命周期模型</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>新品需求通常经历「引入→增长→成熟→衰退」四阶段</li>\n<li>用 Bass 扩散模型或类比法预测初始轨迹</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>基础模型优势</strong>：TimesFM 的零样本能力在冷启动场景最有价值——哪怕只有 2 周数据也能产出合理预测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估与业务对齐\">评估与业务对齐</h2><p>需求预测的评估不应只看统计指标，更要看业务 KPI：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>统计指标</th>\n<th>对应业务 KPI</th>\n<th>关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WAPE</td>\n<td>预测准确率</td>\n<td>直接映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P95 分位覆盖率</td>\n<td>服务水平</td>\n<td>覆盖率 = 不缺货率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bias（偏差）</td>\n<td>库存成本</td>\n<td>正偏 = 库存过多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CRPS</td>\n<td>安全库存设定</td>\n<td>分布越准，安全库存越低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>损失不对称性</strong>：缺货损失通常远大于过剩损失（缺货 = 销售损失 + 客户流失；过剩 = 仓储成本 + 降价处理）。因此需要：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>预测上分位数（而非均值）来设定补货点</li>\n<li>或使用非对称损失函数直接优化模型</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>需求预测的核心挑战是稀疏性、促销效应和层次一致性</li>\n<li>间歇性需求需要专门方法（Croston/零膨胀模型）</li>\n<li>促销建模采用「基线 × 提升因子」的分离策略</li>\n<li>层次调和确保各粒度预测逻辑一致</li>\n<li>业务 KPI（服务水平/库存成本）比统计指标更重要</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>预测精度如何量化 → <a href=\"../foundations/evaluation-metrics\">预测评估指标体系</a></li>\n<li>促销效应的因果推断方法 → <a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/statistical-methods/hypothesis-testing\">假设检验基础</a></li>\n<li>零样本预测在冷启动中的应用 → <a href=\"../machine-learning/foundation-models\">时间序列基础模型</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"需求预测","id":"需求预测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"间歇性需求与稀疏序列","id":"间歇性需求与稀疏序列"},{"level":2,"text":"促销效应建模","id":"促销效应建模"},{"level":2,"text":"层次预测与调和","id":"层次预测与调和"},{"level":2,"text":"新品与冷启动","id":"新品与冷启动"},{"level":2,"text":"评估与业务对齐","id":"评估与业务对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"在线预测服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/systems/online-serving"},"next":{"title":"金融时序预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications/financial-forecasting"}}